+// =================================================================
+// OrcaXR Android (FullSpectrum Local-Z, patch 0047 — LZ3 helpers batch 3).
+// Row-sequence decoders: turn a MixedFilament row's manual_pattern /
+// gradient_component_ids / gradient_component_weights strings into
+// per-extruder cycles, plus the LocalZActivePair struct that the
+// build_local_z_pair_cycle_for_row helper (future patch) emits.
+// All helpers static, dead code until later batches consume them.
+// Source: FS v0.9.9 PrintObjectSlice.cpp lines 1597-1971.
